WEBVTT

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:03.550
The Evangelion of the past

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:09.430
The ultimate anti-human war weapon created by man

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:11.120
The human-made Evangelion

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.550
Shinji Ikari, you're going to ride it

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:13.850
Go!

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.280
There's no way I can ride this!

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.220
If you're going to ride it, hurry up

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.070
If you don't, go home!

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:19.990
I can't run away!

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:21.840
I can't run away!

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:22.810
I can't run away!

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:24.920
I'm going to ride it!

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:25.910
Eva can defeat the Angel

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:29.370
As long as we don't defeat the Angel, we have no future

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:29.830
15 years

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:32.950
In the second impact, half of humanity was lost.

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:37.270
Now, if the capital causes a third impact, people will perish.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:38.790
He's here again.

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:39.750
I can't believe it.

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:40.770
Your father's job.

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:42.290
I have no choice but to get on the Eva.

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:44.890
That's why I was called by my father.

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:46.910
That's why I have no choice but to get on the Eva.

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:48.570
Whether or not to continue the pilot of the Eva,

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:50.010
you decide for yourself.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.000
I'll get on it again.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.280
You won't die.

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:54.800
I'll protect you.

00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:56.580
He got on the Eva without running away.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:58.590
As long as he doesn't get off on his own will,

00:00:58.830 --> 00:00:59.690
I'll leave him to Paris.

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:01.480
I'll do my best.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:01.720
Good luck.

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:02.440
Goodbye.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:04.590
I have nothing else.

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:05.310
I love you!

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:08.040
I don't know what I should look like at a time like this.

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:10.320
If you laugh, you'll look like a person.

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:11.640
The children who have been destined.

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:16.770
Shikinami Asuka Langley vs. Eva No. 2.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:17.430
I'm the pilot.

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:18.470
You're an idiot.

00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:20.370
Are there people who are happy to be on Eva?

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:21.690
I'm not good at it, Dad.

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:22.950
It's my first time praising you.

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:24.590
You did a good job, Shinji.

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.350
I'm glad to be praised for the first time.

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:27.650
Human preservation plan.

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:28.640
What is Nerf trying to do behind the scenes?

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:29.360
What are you trying to do?

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:30.880
Please protect Kirani.

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:32.760
If I'm with Ikari-kun, I'll be happy.

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:34.160
That means you like him!

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:35.500
You're funny.

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:37.760
You don't have the happiness of being on EVA.

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:38.840
Even if you say it's your goal...

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:39.560
Asuka is on it!

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:40.660
Dad!

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:41.620
He's an angel.

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:42.720
He's our enemy.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:43.120
No!

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:44.500
What's wrong with you, Dad?

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:45.560
Are you running away again?

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:46.860
Get out of here, even if it's a bad thing!

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:47.740
It's my fault!

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:49.260
I don't want to be on EVA anymore.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.740
Even if you're being mean like this, it's not fun at all.

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:54.500
Ikari-kun, you don't have to be on EVA!

00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:58.780
I'm Evangelion's first class pilot, Shinji Ikari!

00:01:58.860 --> 00:01:59.870
Ayanami...

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:10.480
I'm sorry. I couldn't do anything.

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:14.750
Second Impact's...

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.660
The third impact is starting.

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:17.500
The time has come.

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:18.620
The world is ending.

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:23.580
Ikari Shinji, you don't have to do anything anymore.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:24.780
Am I not allowed to ride?

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:26.540
It's weird, Misato-san.

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:28.160
I don't understand why this happened suddenly.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:29.740
From now on,

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:30.390
It's been 14 years.

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:33.160
We are the Vile, an organization that aims to destroy the NERV.

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:36.820
I am Kaoru, Nagisa Kaoru.

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:39.480
I am a child who has been destined to be like you.

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:41.240
Evangelion, Unit 13.

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:44.810
When the time comes, get on this Eva with that boy.

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:46.070
Please don't get on Eva alone!

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:47.930
Rei is no longer here, Shinji.

00:02:48.070 --> 00:02:48.230
You're lying!

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:51.650
Eva Unit 01, which was awakened once and opened the door to GAF,

00:02:52.210 --> 00:02:53.230
became the trigger for the Third Impact.

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:57.440
You are the trigger for everything.

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:58.840
You saved me back then, didn't you?

00:02:58.900 --> 00:02:59.440
I don't know.

00:02:59.440 --> 00:02:59.840
Haji

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:03.290
Shinji Kaki is planning to make a third impact again!

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:05.850
I'll get the spear for Kaoru-kun and everyone else!

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:08.910
If I do that, the world will go back!

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:11.760
If I do that, even Misato-san will...

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:13.120
Misato! The DSS director!

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:14.380
No, Shinji-kun!

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:15.320
Stop it, you idiot!

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:16.680
What am I?

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:18.450
Force Impact.

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:20.470
The ritual of its beginning.

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:22.220
It's my fault.

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:24.210
It's because I pulled out the spear!

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:25.710
This is an order.

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:26.650
Don't make that face.

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:29.600
We'll meet again, Shinji-kun.

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.690
You're really a brat.

00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:35.010
There is no sin that cannot be forgiven.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:38.520
Hope is still there.

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:39.910
No matter what.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:18.340
This is the first time I've seen such a thing in a long time, so I'm looking forward to the next time.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:24.910
Thank you for watching until the end.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:26.260
See you next time.

