No good! I can't find a shortcut to stage 5!

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:29.650
Don't say no!

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:34.020
It's too late to overwrite the data in the remaining time!

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.160
Don't say it's impossible! Increase the bypass!

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:38.760
But, Secretary, we don't have much time.

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:40.710
Don't waste your time!

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:41.550
Where?

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:58.110
Thank you for watching this video.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:00.960
We are being tested by Fuyutsuki's deputy commander.

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:10.900
High-energy reaction! Increasing!

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:13.270
All ships, G-to-1 defense shift!

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:15.920
All ships, anti-shock, anti-inferno defense!

