But now I want to know.

02:03:35.370 --> 02:03:36.050
Father's bed.

02:03:36.230 --> 02:03:49.070
Are you afraid of me, Shinji?

02:03:51.010 --> 02:03:51.810
This me.

02:03:52.110 --> 02:03:57.540
I didn't throw it away, I gave it to you.

02:04:06.910 --> 02:04:08.310
It was the same as me, Dad.

02:04:09.780 --> 02:04:10.820
Ah, that's right.

02:04:12.250 --> 02:04:14.030
The headphones cut me off from the outside world.

02:04:15.490 --> 02:04:19.580
They predicted my insensitivity and protected me from other people's noise.

02:04:30.000 --> 02:04:31.370
Do you want to decide this?

02:04:31.370 --> 02:04:35.260
If it's a man, I'll choose Shinji. If it's a woman, I'll choose Rei.

02:04:35.280 --> 02:04:37.970
Shinji, Rei.

02:04:38.170 --> 02:04:49.850
I will become a parent.

02:04:50.710 --> 02:04:54.220
After all, this world is unstable, imperfect, and unfair.

02:04:54.700 --> 02:04:57.470
The world doesn't work well even if you accept it as other people say.

02:05:00.730 --> 02:05:06.920
I don't know which one is right for me.

02:05:07.560 --> 02:05:10.680
Maybe both of them are right for that person.

02:05:11.120 --> 02:05:13.330
It's just that the feeling at that time is different.

02:05:13.630 --> 02:05:16.900
I was afraid of being connected with people.

02:05:17.360 --> 02:05:19.510
I hated the world that was overflowing with people.

02:05:20.010 --> 02:05:22.350
I've been lonely since I was a child.

02:05:22.350 --> 02:05:22.770
It was everyday.

02:05:23.760 --> 02:05:24.640
So I don't feel lonely.

02:05:25.620 --> 02:05:29.200
But the world doesn't like it.

02:05:29.200 --> 02:05:29.300
I can't believe it.

02:05:30.000 --> 02:05:32.350
I didn't want to go to other people's house.

02:05:32.890 --> 02:05:37.010
I didn't want to be taken to a classmate's house or a relative's house.

02:05:37.500 --> 02:05:40.410
I didn't want to push the information and implementation of that life.

02:05:41.670 --> 02:05:43.660
It's painful to be with others.

02:05:44.400 --> 02:05:47.100
I always wanted to be alone.

02:05:47.560 --> 02:05:51.040
I've had two things I've liked since I was a child.

02:05:51.720 --> 02:05:53.140
One is knowledge.

02:05:53.500 --> 02:05:57.160
The knowledge I got was what filled my heart.

02:05:57.160 --> 02:05:58.560
Thank you for the knowledge that filled my heart.

02:06:00.000 --> 02:06:00.780
I don't need to be careful.

02:06:00.920 --> 02:06:04.810
As long as I have time, I can give as much as I want.

02:06:05.950 --> 02:06:08.390
The other one is the piano.

02:06:08.650 --> 02:06:12.490
The tuned sound returns the correct sound of the keyboard.

02:06:13.210 --> 02:06:17.000
There is no lie there.

02:06:17.160 --> 02:06:18.620
There is no betrayal or despair.

02:06:19.160 --> 02:06:22.370
It converts me into the flow of the sound.

02:06:23.010 --> 02:06:24.330
I like that system.

02:06:24.910 --> 02:06:26.400
I like the bird.

02:06:26.960 --> 02:06:29.440
I, others, and everyone.

02:06:30.000 --> 02:06:31.760
I was happy to be alone.

02:06:32.320 --> 02:06:38.710
But when I met Yui, I felt that living was fun.

02:06:39.890 --> 02:06:44.280
Only Yui accepted me as I was.

02:06:45.140 --> 02:06:49.390
I lost Yui.

02:06:50.940 --> 02:06:53.840
I lost confidence in living alone.

02:06:54.860 --> 02:06:58.140
I felt the pain of loneliness for the first time.

02:07:00.670 --> 02:07:03.050
I couldn't bear to lose Yui.

02:07:03.610 --> 02:07:08.060
I just wanted to cry in Yui's heart.

02:07:09.970 --> 02:07:12.530
I just wanted to change myself by being by Yui's side.

02:07:14.210 --> 02:07:18.770
I wanted to make that wish come true.

02:07:18.870 --> 02:07:24.950
Because of my weakness, I can't meet Yui.

02:07:30.060 --> 02:07:31.680
I don't think it's because I don't accept your weakness.

02:07:32.520 --> 02:07:36.220
You've known it all along, haven't you?

02:07:36.220 --> 02:07:44.110
It's you, Sato-san.

02:08:24.320 --> 02:08:28.300
It's impossible to have a new spear that can rewrite the world.

02:08:30.220 --> 02:08:33.270
The Spear of Hope, Cassius, and the Spear of Despair, Longinus.

02:08:33.290 --> 02:08:37.060
Even if you lose your hand, the Spear was created with the will to return the world to its original state.

02:08:39.160 --> 02:08:42.130
Gaius... No, the Spear of Vile.

02:08:42.670 --> 02:08:47.270
Human beings with the will and wisdom have come this far without the help of God.

02:08:48.590 --> 02:08:49.600
Yui!

02:09:41.260 --> 02:09:54.560
I'm sorry, Ryouchi.

02:10:06.430 --> 02:10:08.320
Thank you, Mr. Hisato.

02:10:08.500 --> 02:10:14.230
I'm an adult now that I can accept the thought of someone else's death.

02:10:14.700 --> 02:10:17.960
As a material to reconstruct Shinji and Yui,

02:10:20.620 --> 02:10:25.880
I didn't know if I needed Shinji or not until the end.

02:10:26.140 --> 02:10:27.940
There is no reward for making a wish.

02:10:30.000 --> 02:10:33.230
I felt that the child was a punishment for me.

02:10:33.650 --> 02:10:39.190
I thought that the fact that I was not involved in the child was my food.

02:10:40.250 --> 02:10:43.290
I believed that it would be better for the child.

02:11:07.870 --> 02:11:10.430
I'm sorry, Shinji.

02:11:12.700 --> 02:11:17.460
I see. So that's where you were, Huey.

02:11:30.830 --> 02:11:35.050
Gendo Ikari. He is the center of the security this time, the source of the source.

02:11:36.350 --> 02:11:40.680
I'll take care of it from here, Shinji Ikari. What do you want?

02:11:41.660 --> 02:11:48.500
I'm fine. I think it's okay if it's hard. I want to help Asuka and everyone else more than me.

02:11:48.660 --> 02:11:56.970
That's right. You're not an imaginary, you're already standing up in reality, aren't you?

02:11:56.990 --> 02:11:59.980
Yes. What my father did...

02:12:00.000 --> 02:12:03.280
I'll take care of the rest, Asuka.

02:12:03.360 --> 02:12:06.790
I don't know.

02:12:06.830 --> 02:12:07.860
I don't have a mother.

02:12:09.600 --> 02:12:11.940
So I don't need anyone.

02:12:12.200 --> 02:12:13.160
Asuka.

02:12:16.900 --> 02:12:17.400
I don't need anyone.

02:12:17.520 --> 02:12:18.080
I'll do my best.

02:12:18.360 --> 02:12:21.210
If I don't do that, it'll be hard.

02:12:21.510 --> 02:12:23.630
It's hard to come.

02:12:30.990 --> 02:12:31.590
Get on the Eva.

02:12:31.590 --> 02:12:57.240
Even if you're hated, even if you're bad-mouthed,

02:12:57.240 --> 02:12:58.680
it doesn't matter if you get on the Eva.

02:13:00.090 --> 02:13:01.010
I don't have any other values.

02:13:01.710 --> 02:13:04.800
I don't need anyone else.

02:13:05.220 --> 02:13:07.500
I have a strong body and a strong heart.

02:13:07.800 --> 02:13:08.950
Praise me!

02:13:10.720 --> 02:13:12.050
Accept me!

02:13:12.810 --> 02:13:15.110
Give me a place to stay!

02:13:15.370 --> 02:13:17.620
I'm really lonely.

02:13:18.040 --> 02:13:29.890
I just want to pet you.

02:13:30.030 --> 02:13:30.510
I just wanted it.

02:13:30.910 --> 02:13:48.230
It's okay. Asuka is Asuka. That's enough.

02:14:00.120 --> 02:14:00.540
She was asleep.

02:14:00.720 --> 02:14:03.670
You're so stupid, Shinji.

02:14:03.910 --> 02:14:04.880
I'm glad.

02:14:05.180 --> 02:14:08.930
I wanted to tell her this.

02:14:09.720 --> 02:14:12.730
Thank you for telling me that you love me.

02:14:13.170 --> 02:14:16.480
I love you too, Asuka.

02:14:22.470 --> 02:14:23.230
Goodbye, Asuka.

02:14:23.290 --> 02:14:24.430
Take care of Kensuke.

02:14:25.230 --> 02:14:26.810
Princess, good night.

02:14:34.760 --> 02:14:37.020
See you later, Shinji-kun. Aren't you lonely?

02:14:37.660 --> 02:14:39.540
Yeah, I'm fine.

02:14:39.920 --> 02:14:42.800
It's your turn this time, Kaoru-kun.

02:14:42.860 --> 02:14:48.680
I remembered. I've come here many times, and I've met you.

02:14:49.280 --> 02:14:50.730
I've been named in the book of life.

02:14:51.950 --> 02:14:53.220
We meet many times.

02:14:53.780 --> 02:14:57.350
I'm you. I'm the same as you.

02:14:57.550 --> 02:14:59.640
That's why I was attracted to you.

02:15:00.730 --> 02:15:01.750
I wanted to make him happy.

02:15:02.330 --> 02:15:05.860
That's right. Kaoru-kun is like his father.

02:15:06.600 --> 02:15:08.420
That's why he was on the same Eva.

02:15:09.400 --> 02:15:12.590
You're different from usual, Shinji-kun.

02:15:12.750 --> 02:15:13.940
Aren't you going to cry?

02:15:14.400 --> 02:15:18.380
Yeah. I'm the only one who can save him from tears.

02:15:18.780 --> 02:15:22.360
Even if I cry, no one else can save me.

02:15:22.420 --> 02:15:25.370
That's why I won't cry anymore.

02:15:26.220 --> 02:15:28.530
I see. You've already grown up.

02:15:30.090 --> 02:15:31.770
It's a little lonely, but that's good.

02:15:32.150 --> 02:15:37.370
Kaoru, I'm going to dispose of your Eva in Unit 13.

02:15:37.850 --> 02:15:40.840
Yeah, throw away the Eva.

02:15:40.980 --> 02:15:44.360
I'm sorry, I misunderstood your happiness.

02:15:45.460 --> 02:15:48.440
Yeah, that was your happiness.

02:15:48.940 --> 02:15:52.880
Commander Nagisa, you don't want to make Shinji happy.

02:15:53.880 --> 02:15:56.740
That's why I wanted you to be happy.

02:16:00.510 --> 02:16:02.870
The only thing that can erase my existence is the collapse of space and time.

02:16:03.390 --> 02:16:07.020
That's why I have to repeat what I play in the story of the predetermined distant ship.

02:16:10.780 --> 02:16:24.060
It's a magic spell that will make you happy.

02:16:24.240 --> 02:16:29.510
It's a self-correcting...

02:16:30.000 --> 02:16:33.130
I wish for the world to change. Shinji, you're the same.

02:16:33.130 --> 02:16:38.170
That's why you chose him and wrote down the name of the book of life.

02:16:38.910 --> 02:16:41.870
Thank you. Ryo-chan saved me too.

02:16:42.050 --> 02:16:44.000
It's an honor, Commander Nagisa.

02:16:44.340 --> 02:16:47.560
I don't want to, Ryo-chan. Call me Kaoru soon.

02:16:48.020 --> 02:16:51.120
I'm still on leave, Commander Nagisa.

02:16:52.400 --> 02:16:54.820
Nagisa is the border between land and sea.

02:16:55.220 --> 02:16:58.570
The first and the thirteenth people of mankind.

02:17:00.030 --> 02:17:02.050
It's your new name.

02:17:02.170 --> 02:17:04.500
You've fulfilled your mission.

02:17:04.960 --> 02:17:07.760
After that, you can ask him to take over.

02:17:08.380 --> 02:17:15.660
How about working in the field with Katsuragi?

02:17:16.340 --> 02:17:19.920
That's good.

02:17:22.710 --> 02:17:29.180
You're the one who's angry.

02:17:30.000 --> 02:17:31.720
That's all, Ayanami.

02:17:31.920 --> 02:17:34.010
I'm fine here.

02:17:34.840 --> 02:17:37.610
The other you found a place that's not here.

02:17:38.450 --> 02:17:41.670
When Asuka comes back, I think she'll find a new place.

02:17:42.530 --> 02:17:44.540
The happiness of not being on EVA.

02:17:45.240 --> 02:17:46.820
That's what Ikari-kun wanted.

02:17:48.590 --> 02:17:53.140
There's also a way of life that's not here.

02:17:53.360 --> 02:17:54.740
That's right.

02:17:54.860 --> 02:17:55.780
That's right.

02:17:56.860 --> 02:17:59.320
I'll choose a way of life that's not on EVA.

02:18:01.340 --> 02:18:02.600
I can't go back in time or back to the world.

02:18:02.800 --> 02:18:07.200
I just want to rewrite the world into a better one without Eva.

02:18:07.360 --> 02:18:10.750
A world where people can live.

02:18:11.450 --> 02:18:14.210
A new creation of the world.

02:18:14.210 --> 02:18:15.880
Neon Genesis.

02:18:16.850 --> 02:18:17.290
Really?

02:18:19.840 --> 02:18:21.320
Mari will pick you up later.

02:18:21.360 --> 02:18:23.010
So, don't worry.

02:18:23.270 --> 02:18:23.490
Okay.

02:18:36.270 --> 02:18:38.280
I'll give it a try, Ayanami.

02:18:38.380 --> 02:18:40.140
Neon Genesis.

02:19:04.240 --> 02:19:25.720
And he was inside of me.

02:19:39.050 --> 02:19:41.700
Dad wanted to see off his mother.

02:19:41.960 --> 02:19:44.880
That's what Dad wished for.

02:20:01.470 --> 02:20:01.690
Thank you.

02:20:34.030 --> 02:20:42.280
Goodbye, all of Evangelion.

02:21:31.880 --> 02:21:32.140
She

02:22:00.760 --> 02:22:00.980
Thanks for watching!

02:23:01.280 --> 02:23:01.840
Thank you.

02:23:01.860 --> 02:23:06.390
8+, 9+, 10+, 11+, 12th season.

02:23:06.530 --> 02:23:07.930
Thank you for your hard work.

02:23:08.190 --> 02:23:10.320
The last Evangelion.

02:23:10.420 --> 02:23:26.280
Sorry to keep you waiting, Shinji-kun.

02:23:35.630 --> 02:23:37.390
The train will soon arrive.

02:23:37.590 --> 02:23:41.240
It's dangerous, so please step up to the yellow change block.

02:24:07.480 --> 02:24:09.420
You have a big chest.

02:24:10.020 --> 02:24:12.510
5 meters.

02:24:12.970 --> 02:24:20.130
You smell good.

02:24:20.170 --> 02:24:21.200
You smell like an adult.

02:24:22.000 --> 02:24:28.090
You're as cute as ever.

02:24:28.170 --> 02:24:29.240
Hoho.

02:24:30.190 --> 02:24:31.910
I'll be waiting for you to listen to my one-shot speech.

02:24:33.230 --> 02:24:40.690
Shinji-kun.

02:24:40.770 --> 02:24:46.660
Let's go!

02:24:46.880 --> 02:24:55.200
My first Louvre was...

02:24:55.200 --> 02:24:57.040
It was nothing like that.

02:24:57.480 --> 02:24:59.320
It was my own Mona Lisa.

02:25:00.000 --> 02:25:03.660
I met you a long time ago, so I saw you for the first time

02:25:03.660 --> 02:25:06.060
The car that started to move that day

02:25:06.060 --> 02:25:08.980
I can't stop the feeling of loss

02:25:59.084 --> 02:25:59.404
Mama.

02:26:00.000 --> 02:26:00.680
The projector in my heart

02:26:01.400 --> 02:26:03.420
I pretended not to be lonely

02:26:03.920 --> 02:26:05.600
Well, that's up to each other

02:26:06.160 --> 02:26:07.520
Seeking someone

02:26:07.520 --> 02:26:09.620
In other words, it was hurt

02:30:00.760 --> 02:30:00.880
Thank you.

02:30:30.000 --> 02:30:55.560
Thank you for watching until the end.

02:31:39.560 --> 02:31:39.720
you

02:33:30.800 --> 02:33:31.100
Thank you.

02:34:01.630 --> 02:34:03.210
It's only love.
